  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648828641a449c1aa12821d5-b4286c1a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While veggies are roasting, finely chop brown onion and garlic.\n• Roughly chop silverbeet.\n• Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648828641a449c1aa12821d5-16b05228.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil and half the butter over medium-high heat.\n• Add onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add garlic and garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water, vegetable stock pot and sweetcorn. Stir to combine, bring to the boil, then reduce heat to medium and simmer until slightly reduced, 4-6 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648828641a449c1aa12821d5-0d1287d4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the soup is simmering, cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into bite-sized chunks and place on a second lined oven tray.\n• Add a drizzle of olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Sprinkle over shredded Cheddar cheese. Bake until golden, 5-7 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648828641a449c1aa12821d5-18c3caad.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Remove soup from the heat and stir through silverbeet, roasted veggies, plant-based cooking cream and remaining butter, until melted and wilted, 1 minute. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648828641a449c1aa12821d5-9fa32565.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop chives.\n• Divide the creamy potato & corn soup between bowls.\n• Top with the cheesy croutons and chives. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-648828641a449c1aa12821d5-aff4155e.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
